ter virtual reality headsets in  several studies researchers showed that  eliminating worn out cells could make  mice less prone to some diseases of  Aging and it could extend their lives by  20% now human trials are taking aim at  the role of senescence cells and  arthritis in a clever experiment that  involved video and a man in an ape suit  researchers showed that chimps  orangutans and bonobos understand when  another eight holds a false belief that  shows they have theory of mind which  some researchers had thought was unique  to humans  and now the breakthrough of the year  early this year scientists at LIGO  confirmed one of Albert Einstein's  boldest predictions that whirling masses  can shake the very fabric of space-time  generating tiny ripples using  instruments in Louisiana and Washington  state they detected gravitational waves  the discovery opens the door to new ways  of listening to our universe and  thinking about how it works  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  you  [Applause]

